WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.074
Do you want subtitles for any video?
-=[ ai.OpenSubtitles.com ]=-

2
00:00:27.625 --> 00:00:31.101
<i>The era of the Jedi
and the Sith has ended.</i>

3
00:00:31.125 --> 00:00:33.309
<i>They have all but disappeared.</i>

4
00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:37.643
<i>and with them. the ancient art
of crafting their sacred weapon.</i>

5
00:00:37.667 --> 00:00:40.018
<i>the lightsaber.</i>

6
00:00:40.042 --> 00:00:46.583
<i>A terrible age of conflict now mires
the galaxy in chaos as warlords rise.</i>

7
00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:52.601
<i>Among them. the fierce masked general.
Nawaam. has emerged.</i>

8
00:00:52.625 --> 00:00:58.309
<i>spreading terror as planets fall under
his control at an alarming rate.</i>

9
00:00:58.333 --> 00:01:03.976
<i>Amid this. Margrave Juro works
to bring back the Jedi Order</i>

10
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:09.125
<i>in hope that they can restore
peace and justice to the galaxy.</i>

11
00:01:32.542 --> 00:01:35.851
How are they doing this? They keep finding
us no matter how many times we jump.

12
00:01:35.875 --> 00:01:38.518
There must be a tracker
on the ship somewhere.

13
00:01:38.542 --> 00:01:41.268
They probably put one on us
during our first run-in.

14
00:01:41.292 --> 00:01:42.832
<i>What?</i>

15
00:01:49.333 --> 00:01:53.226
Lord Nawaam. I will soon
have Margrave Juro's ship.

16
00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:56.518
This will be the day
I wipe out his pathetic group

17
00:01:56.542 --> 00:01:58.684
and return with all of their lightsabers.

18
00:01:58.708 --> 00:02:02.434
<i>Our enemies see themselves
as masterless Jedi.</i>

19
00:02:02.458 --> 00:02:05.101
<i>You'd be wise to not let your guard down.</i>

20
00:02:05.125 --> 00:02:08.143
I. Gennoh. would never
back down from any Jedi.

21
00:02:08.167 --> 00:02:10.059
<i>Very well.</i>

22
00:02:10.083 --> 00:02:12.351
<i>Then show me the power of the last Sith.</i>

23
00:02:12.375 --> 00:02:14.042
As you wish.

24
00:02:38.917 --> 00:02:41.143
Master. the ship's navicomputer is down.

25
00:02:41.167 --> 00:02:43.018
And what about the backup?

26
00:02:43.042 --> 00:02:44.851
Those are all shot as well.

27
00:02:44.875 --> 00:02:47.768
There's no way we'll be able
to make a jump to hyperspace without them.

28
00:02:47.792 --> 00:02:49.476
Can you repair it. Kara?

29
00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:51.393
<i>There's no time.
We won't make it.</i>

30
00:02:51.417 --> 00:02:53.559
All right. Take the controls. Gramps.

31
00:02:53.583 --> 00:02:57.059
Get ready to make the jump
as soon as we get into a better position.

32
00:02:57.083 --> 00:03:00.809
Good grief. Very reckless. kid.
Very reckless.

33
00:03:00.833 --> 00:03:02.351
The coordinates?

34
00:03:02.375 --> 00:03:04.893
I've got all that stuff
up here in my noggin.

35
00:03:04.917 --> 00:03:07.166
Well. then. where are you taking us?

36
00:03:11.833 --> 00:03:14.750
Jump as many times
as you wish. It's still futile.

37
00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:21.750
I have you now.

38
00:03:32.667 --> 00:03:35.542
Gramps.
are you seeing what I'm seeing?

39
00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:39.393
Do something. We're being
pulled right into that black hole.

40
00:03:39.417 --> 00:03:43.500
Relax. A ship this nimble
will be able to make it out easy.

41
00:03:44.333 --> 00:03:47.750
Not sure about that big clunker
behind us. though.

42
00:03:48.542 --> 00:03:50.684
<i>High gravitational pull detected.</i>

43
00:03:50.708 --> 00:03:52.208
<i>Navigation disabled.</i>

44
00:03:53.125 --> 00:03:55.268
Of all the petty tricks...

45
00:03:55.292 --> 00:03:57.018
That was quick thinking.

46
00:03:57.042 --> 00:03:58.768
Quite the strategy. Gramps.

47
00:03:58.792 --> 00:04:01.268
Enough compliments.
We need to get out of here now.

48
00:04:01.292 --> 00:04:03.791
Things are about to get
a little bumpy.

49
00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:26.393
Whoo-hoo!

50
00:04:26.417 --> 00:04:27.625
Gramps. you're the best!

51
00:04:28.417 --> 00:04:32.143
That is accurate.
We have escaped the black hole.

52
00:04:32.167 --> 00:04:34.851
Now then.
where shall we jump to next?

53
00:04:34.875 --> 00:04:38.184
Our best course of action
would be to head to Makoma Ko.

54
00:04:38.208 --> 00:04:39.684
Set a course immediately.

55
00:04:39.708 --> 00:04:41.000
All righty.

56
00:04:58.042 --> 00:04:59.542
<i>We have insufficient thrust.</i>

57
00:05:00.083 --> 00:05:01.542
I'll handle this.

58
00:05:35.542 --> 00:05:37.375
So this is Makoma Ko.

59
00:05:39.042 --> 00:05:41.309
It's ruled by a man named Dunbai.

60
00:05:41.333 --> 00:05:43.768
He was a Jedi a long time ago.

61
00:05:43.792 --> 00:05:46.309
A Jedi. that's a surprise.

62
00:05:46.333 --> 00:05:48.059
Dunbai is well known.

63
00:05:48.083 --> 00:05:50.768
He's one of the wealthiest merchants
in the Outer Rim.

64
00:05:50.792 --> 00:05:53.042
Hard to imagine he was once a Jedi.

65
00:05:53.875 --> 00:05:58.250
Hmm. Then I really hope
he'll be able to help us.

66
00:06:42.167 --> 00:06:47.143
Apologies. Margrave. but I'm afraid I will
be unable to lend you any assistance.

67
00:06:47.167 --> 00:06:49.309
Lord Dunbai. do you mean to say

68
00:06:49.333 --> 00:06:52.292
that you will allow the galaxy
to continue to fall into chaos?

69
00:06:52.958 --> 00:06:56.768
My primary duty must be
to protect my home. Makoma Ko.

70
00:06:56.792 --> 00:06:58.750
My hands are full enough with that.

71
00:07:04.917 --> 00:07:06.750
Hmm. What's this?

72
00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:09.976
It is a saber forged by Lah Zhima.

73
00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:14.667
I ask you again. will you take this up
and fight once more as a Jedi?

74
00:07:18.542 --> 00:07:21.226
You will never be able
to bring back the Jedi Order

75
00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:23.226
with such a paltry number.

76
00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:25.833
And furthermore.
there is no master among you.

77
00:07:26.583 --> 00:07:30.750
You're wrong. We do have
a master. and his name is Margrave Juro.

78
00:07:34.333 --> 00:07:36.768
If you have the strength
to stand up against Nawaam.

79
00:07:36.792 --> 00:07:38.726
I have no doubt others will follow.

80
00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:42.125
This is an opportunity to provide them
with a beacon of hope.

81
00:07:43.708 --> 00:07:45.143
Hmm.

82
00:07:45.167 --> 00:07:46.726
That may be.

83
00:07:46.750 --> 00:07:50.851
However. blindly gathering others
won't bring the Jedi back.

84
00:07:50.875 --> 00:07:53.893
I can only hope that you will
not find yourselves crushed

85
00:07:53.917 --> 00:07:56.667
if you insist on pursuing
this fool-hearted quest.

86
00:07:57.458 --> 00:08:00.750
Although I seriously doubt
this Nawaam would be the one to do it.

87
00:08:01.542 --> 00:08:03.934
You should not underestimate Nawaam.

88
00:08:03.958 --> 00:08:06.518
As we speak. he is busy amassing a fleet.

89
00:08:06.542 --> 00:08:08.958
and soon it will be
the biggest in the galaxy.

90
00:08:09.625 --> 00:08:12.101
His Nobuseri fighters are a problem.

91
00:08:12.125 --> 00:08:15.684
A throng of brutes
who have never bent the knee to anyone

92
00:08:15.708 --> 00:08:17.667
now swear allegiance to him.

93
00:08:18.583 --> 00:08:22.101
What do you imagine
he may have promised them in return?

94
00:08:22.125 --> 00:08:24.875
Nawaam's danger lies at the heart
of what that may be.

95
00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:26.500
Hmm.

96
00:08:27.417 --> 00:08:30.476
I thought you said
Dunbai used to be a Jedi.

97
00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:32.976
Seems he's no more
than a greedy merchant now.

98
00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:36.125
Does this mean that he really
isn't going to help us?

99
00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:42.875
Who is this girl with you?

100
00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:47.083
Lah Kara. She is Zhima's daughter.

101
00:08:50.583 --> 00:08:52.351
So then he survived?

102
00:08:52.375 --> 00:08:56.559
Yes. But he was abducted.
likely on Nawaam's orders.

103
00:08:56.583 --> 00:09:01.708
So you are traveling with Margrave Juro
in search of your father. is that correct?

104
00:09:02.333 --> 00:09:04.018
How brave of you.

105
00:09:04.042 --> 00:09:07.143
We need your help.
Please lend us your aid.

106
00:09:07.167 --> 00:09:09.976
I fear. without it.
I won't be able to find my father.

107
00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:13.351
I'm sorry.
but as I have already explained.

108
00:09:13.375 --> 00:09:16.393
what matters most to me
is protecting this planet and its people.

109
00:09:16.417 --> 00:09:17.875
And so I cannot help you.

110
00:09:18.542 --> 00:09:20.750
But you're not safe just sitting idly by.

111
00:09:21.833 --> 00:09:22.833
I thought that once.

112
00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:26.542
Until one day they came
and took what matters most.

113
00:09:29.208 --> 00:09:31.792
I'm sorry. I should not have
spoken to you that way.

114
00:09:33.958 --> 00:09:36.917
I apologize for speaking like that.
Margrave Juro.

115
00:09:38.167 --> 00:09:39.851
It's quite all right.

116
00:09:39.875 --> 00:09:42.226
You have expressed my sentiments exactly.

117
00:09:42.250 --> 00:09:47.125
Although there is one thing. Kara.
you can just call me Juro. remember?

118
00:09:47.833 --> 00:09:49.375
Yes. Juro.

119
00:10:03.333 --> 00:10:06.250
It appears you and your friends
have brought trouble to our door.

120
00:10:06.875 --> 00:10:08.291
Hmm?

121
00:10:19.333 --> 00:10:23.143
Did you think you could get away
from me with that little stunt?

122
00:10:23.167 --> 00:10:25.624
How naive of you. Jedi.

123
00:10:28.083 --> 00:10:29.893
How'd they find us?

124
00:10:29.917 --> 00:10:31.726
I thought we destroyed the tracker.

125
00:10:31.750 --> 00:10:34.541
We did destroy it.
When we arrived at the spaceport.

126
00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:41.018
I wonder how he managed to escape
the gravitational pull of the black hole.

127
00:10:41.042 --> 00:10:43.351
Unfortunate. but very impressive.

128
00:10:43.375 --> 00:10:45.125
Can you please stop praising him?

129
00:10:48.458 --> 00:10:51.476
Excuse me. sir. we are receiving
an incoming transmission.

130
00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:52.917
It is from Nawaam's army.

131
00:11:02.750 --> 00:11:05.750
<i>I am Commander Gennoh of Nawaam's army.</i>

132
00:11:06.667 --> 00:11:10.143
<i>We have been informed that you are
harboring these seditious Jedi.</i>

133
00:11:10.167 --> 00:11:12.333
<i>and we demand
that you hand them over to us.</i>

134
00:11:13.542 --> 00:11:16.226
Well. I'm afraid
I have received no reports

135
00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:18.851
of any such Jedi hiding on this planet.

136
00:11:18.875 --> 00:11:19.976
Isn't that right?

137
00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:22.184
<i>Have you no shame?</i>

138
00:11:22.208 --> 00:11:24.143
But even if they were here.

139
00:11:24.167 --> 00:11:28.434
I would not be duty-bound
to turn them over to your custody.

140
00:11:28.458 --> 00:11:31.934
Might I remind you
that Makoma Ko are a free city-state.

141
00:11:31.958 --> 00:11:35.309
As such. we are not under
the control of the Nawaam army.

142
00:11:35.333 --> 00:11:38.393
And in terms of rival warlords
we may be bound to. there are none.

143
00:11:38.417 --> 00:11:40.184
<i>You wretched cur.</i>

144
00:11:40.208 --> 00:11:42.101
<i>Do you intend to defy General Nawaam?</i>

145
00:11:42.125 --> 00:11:44.601
And what is it that you intend?

146
00:11:44.625 --> 00:11:48.708
Perhaps you intend to violate
the autonomy of Makoma Ko.

147
00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:53.434
Is he doing what I think he's doing?

148
00:11:53.458 --> 00:11:55.476
'Cause it looks like he's helping us.

149
00:11:55.500 --> 00:11:58.417
- No matter how stubborn Dunbai may be...
- Hmm?

150
00:11:59.292 --> 00:12:01.458
He is a man of high principle.

151
00:12:03.167 --> 00:12:07.958
<i>Very well. in that case.
you shall die alongside your Jedi friends.</i>

152
00:12:12.167 --> 00:12:14.059
Bring the ground troops down.

153
00:12:14.083 --> 00:12:16.625
burn the whole city
and smoke out the Jedi.

154
00:12:17.875 --> 00:12:20.541
And do not forget
to take their lightsabers.

155
00:12:33.208 --> 00:12:34.208
What is that?

156
00:12:41.292 --> 00:12:43.059
- Here they come.
- Oh. they're coming down!

157
00:12:43.083 --> 00:12:44.166
They're landing!

158
00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:11.875
Ready? Lure them closer.

159
00:13:35.292 --> 00:13:36.559
This does not look good.

160
00:13:36.583 --> 00:13:39.166
They're attacking everyone
and everything in sight.

161
00:13:41.708 --> 00:13:43.000
This is horrible.

162
00:13:45.875 --> 00:13:48.976
Hold on. do you see our ship?

163
00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:51.833
The ship's hidden.
You're welcome.

164
00:13:53.042 --> 00:13:54.601
Shall I come get you?

165
00:13:54.625 --> 00:13:56.809
Yeah. but be careful. okay?

166
00:13:56.833 --> 00:13:58.684
Even though we're outnumbered.

167
00:13:58.708 --> 00:14:01.893
these droids are controlled
by a central command unit.

168
00:14:01.917 --> 00:14:05.309
If you take that out. they'll become
nothing more than training dummies.

169
00:14:05.333 --> 00:14:09.976
Wait. Are you seriously proposing that we
directly infiltrate the enemy's ship?

170
00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:11.268
Have you lost your mind?

171
00:14:11.292 --> 00:14:14.417
The element of surprise
is a basic principle of warfare.

172
00:14:15.167 --> 00:14:16.226
Wouldn't you agree?

173
00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:19.559
"It is better to take the right path
than the straight one."

174
00:14:19.583 --> 00:14:23.375
Don't worry. I haven't forgotten the basic
principles of the Jedi's teachings.

175
00:14:27.125 --> 00:14:28.250
Hey. Gramps is here.

176
00:14:30.333 --> 00:14:33.518
Are you really planning
on attempting this alone?

177
00:14:33.542 --> 00:14:36.601
As you said.
your role is to protect your city.

178
00:14:36.625 --> 00:14:40.018
and in doing so. you will
be attracting the enemy's attention.

179
00:14:40.042 --> 00:14:41.976
Hmm?

180
00:14:42.000 --> 00:14:44.893
You'll need it at a time like this.

181
00:14:44.917 --> 00:14:46.101
So keep it.

182
00:14:46.125 --> 00:14:47.957
Are you taking
that child with you?

183
00:14:49.500 --> 00:14:50.976
I told you already.

184
00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:52.559
She's not just any girl.

185
00:14:52.583 --> 00:14:54.559
She's the daughter of Lah Zhima.

186
00:14:54.583 --> 00:14:56.083
Thank you for all your help.

187
00:14:56.917 --> 00:14:59.333
You have nothing to worry about.
We won't be reckless.

188
00:15:02.833 --> 00:15:04.750
Hmm.

189
00:15:10.750 --> 00:15:14.625
We have to get out of this system. now.
It doesn't matter where to.

190
00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:24.309
Where are we?

191
00:15:24.333 --> 00:15:27.559
We're approximately five parsecs
from Makoma Ko right now.

192
00:15:27.583 --> 00:15:29.434
If we jump back there right now.

193
00:15:29.458 --> 00:15:31.851
how close to the target
will we be able to get?

194
00:15:31.875 --> 00:15:35.393
Oh. my!
You are proving to be just as reckless

195
00:15:35.417 --> 00:15:37.542
as young Kara here. sir.

196
00:15:45.833 --> 00:15:47.667
Gramps. we're gonna crash!

197
00:15:57.792 --> 00:16:00.059
You were saying?

198
00:16:00.083 --> 00:16:01.643
Impressive flying.

199
00:16:01.667 --> 00:16:05.083
Our sole objective
is that central droid control unit.

200
00:16:07.083 --> 00:16:09.018
The enemy has infiltrated.

201
00:16:09.042 --> 00:16:11.333
Combat has been detected
on the third deck.

202
00:16:12.083 --> 00:16:14.542
Their petty tricks
just keep on coming.

203
00:16:30.458 --> 00:16:32.518
Lord Dunbai.

204
00:16:32.542 --> 00:16:33.625
Come with me.

205
00:16:34.333 --> 00:16:35.333
Sir.

206
00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:08.018
Hmm. Ah!

207
00:17:08.042 --> 00:17:10.957
There. That path leads directly
to the droid control center.

208
00:17:13.417 --> 00:17:14.726
Don't be reckless.

209
00:17:14.750 --> 00:17:15.750
I know.

210
00:17:28.125 --> 00:17:31.166
And what business might you have
in this room. little mouse?

211
00:17:35.250 --> 00:17:36.768
Identify yourself.

212
00:17:36.792 --> 00:17:38.976
Are you the one in charge of this vessel?

213
00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:41.184
I am Gennoh Ikagi.

214
00:17:41.208 --> 00:17:43.125
The commander of Nawaam's army.

215
00:17:43.958 --> 00:17:48.791
Now you would do well to go to your death
with honor and at my hand.

216
00:17:50.417 --> 00:17:53.309
That's a lightsaber.

217
00:17:53.333 --> 00:17:54.893
How do you have one of those?

218
00:17:54.917 --> 00:17:56.851
Nobody but my father can craft them.

219
00:17:56.875 --> 00:17:58.042
Your father?

220
00:17:59.333 --> 00:18:01.559
Then you are Lah Zhima's daughter?

221
00:18:01.583 --> 00:18:03.893
How do you know who my father is?

222
00:18:03.917 --> 00:18:07.309
He is one of the General's
closest collaborators.

223
00:18:07.333 --> 00:18:09.684
And he has been very cordially received.

224
00:18:09.708 --> 00:18:10.708
What are you saying?

225
00:19:18.542 --> 00:19:22.374
You did well for a girl so young.
but this is the end.

226
00:19:23.458 --> 00:19:25.958
- I think I kept you busy long enough.
- What?

227
00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:29.851
I just needed to keep you distracted

228
00:19:29.875 --> 00:19:32.624
so that my friend over there
could stop your droids.

229
00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:04.393
What was that?

230
00:20:04.417 --> 00:20:08.018
With the droids deactivated.
there's nobody to fly the ship.

231
00:20:08.042 --> 00:20:09.750
Or did you not account for that?

232
00:20:10.708 --> 00:20:11.708
Huh?

233
00:20:13.708 --> 00:20:16.559
Tell me. what's your name. girl?

234
00:20:16.583 --> 00:20:18.018
- Kara.
- Hmm.

235
00:20:18.042 --> 00:20:19.851
Lah Kara.

236
00:20:19.875 --> 00:20:23.750
I will remember that
for the next time we meet.

237
00:20:31.875 --> 00:20:33.167
Huh?

238
00:20:47.875 --> 00:20:50.476
I can't believe
those guys actually pulled it off.

239
00:20:50.500 --> 00:20:52.792
Quite impressive indeed.

240
00:21:18.333 --> 00:21:21.041
Hmm?

241
00:21:29.042 --> 00:21:32.268
He is one of the General's
closest collaborators.

242
00:21:32.292 --> 00:21:34.875
And he has been very cordially received.

243
00:21:36.458 --> 00:21:40.309
<i>Father...
collaborating with Nawaam?</i>

244
00:21:40.333 --> 00:21:42.059
<i>That's impossible.</i>

245
00:21:42.083 --> 00:21:44.500
<i>He would never
willingly work with men like him.</i>

246
00:21:46.375 --> 00:21:47.457
<i>Never.</i>

247
00:21:49.792 --> 00:21:53.601
They may be gone for now.
but this won't be the last we see of them.

248
00:21:53.625 --> 00:21:57.684
Ah. but you forget.
Makoma Ko is a free city-state

249
00:21:57.708 --> 00:21:59.851
and we will yield to no one.

250
00:21:59.875 --> 00:22:02.143
You're as stubborn as ever.

251
00:22:02.167 --> 00:22:03.750
I could say the same of you.

252
00:22:05.458 --> 00:22:08.101
Thanks for this.

253
00:22:08.125 --> 00:22:11.768
However. I left behind
the Jedi life long ago.

254
00:22:11.792 --> 00:22:15.226
You're even more stubborn than I thought.

255
00:22:15.250 --> 00:22:18.184
You don't have to go back to being a Jedi.

256
00:22:18.208 --> 00:22:20.893
but I'm not taking that back either.

257
00:22:20.917 --> 00:22:23.667
Keep it and use it
to protect the people of this planet.

258
00:22:25.125 --> 00:22:26.125
Hmm.

259
00:22:58.875 --> 00:23:01.351
Emergency transmission
from Gennoh.

260
00:23:01.375 --> 00:23:03.559
Juro's group has struck down his ship.

261
00:23:03.583 --> 00:23:05.309
Evacuation underway.

262
00:23:05.333 --> 00:23:08.643
That Margrave Juro
is formidable.

263
00:23:08.667 --> 00:23:10.184
There is more.

264
00:23:10.208 --> 00:23:12.643
Zhima's daughter is accompanying them.

265
00:23:12.667 --> 00:23:16.292
She is attuned to the Force
and not to be underestimated.

266
00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:22.750
Lord Zhima. did you take
your daughter as your Padawan?

267
00:23:23.542 --> 00:23:26.226
She is the daughter
of a sabersmith after all.

268
00:23:26.250 --> 00:23:28.958
It's only natural
that she's picked up a few things.

269
00:23:29.583 --> 00:23:31.500
You toy with me
at your own peril.

270
00:23:32.250 --> 00:23:36.476
Look at you.
one of the strongest of all the Jedi.

271
00:23:36.500 --> 00:23:40.417
yet you still insist on calling yourself
a mere sabersmith?

272
00:24:00.083 --> 00:24:02.768
What?
Of course I'm not scared.

273
00:24:02.792 --> 00:24:05.458
I... I volunteered to do this after all.

274
00:24:08.000 --> 00:24:09.768
You're sure about this?

275
00:24:09.792 --> 00:24:11.976
This mission will be a dangerous one.

276
00:24:12.000 --> 00:24:14.166
I'm sure. Just leave it to me.

277
00:24:16.625 --> 00:24:18.226
It's okay. He'll have backup.

278
00:24:18.250 --> 00:24:20.832
Four-Nines will be there to help
if anything goes wrong.

279
00:24:27.625 --> 00:24:30.809
So is this general
really as great as everyone claims?

280
00:24:30.833 --> 00:24:31.958
Hmm?

281
00:24:33.292 --> 00:24:34.417
We'll know soon enough.

282
00:24:35.125 --> 00:24:36.976
Does anyone else
think it's strange

283
00:24:37.000 --> 00:24:39.559
that we all follow a guy
we don't know anything about?

284
00:24:39.583 --> 00:24:41.351
I heard that if anyone can beat him.

285
00:24:41.375 --> 00:24:43.434
he promised to give them
control of his army.

286
00:24:43.458 --> 00:24:45.583
Do we really think
he's serious about that?

287
00:24:46.750 --> 00:24:48.893
Why are you bringing that up?

288
00:24:48.917 --> 00:24:51.833
I was just curious. that's all.

289
00:24:52.458 --> 00:24:54.375
I am serious.

290
00:25:05.875 --> 00:25:07.768
I do not request your loyalty.

291
00:25:07.792 --> 00:25:11.875
If any of you can kill me.
you may become general in my stead.

292
00:25:12.875 --> 00:25:15.559
However. until that happens.

293
00:25:15.583 --> 00:25:19.333
I am in command
and you will follow my orders.

294
00:25:20.167 --> 00:25:21.167
That is the deal.

295
00:25:22.708 --> 00:25:24.792
Did you want to challenge me?

296
00:25:26.500 --> 00:25:30.542
How about you. masterless Jedi?

297
00:25:32.833 --> 00:25:36.208
I have no idea what you're talking about.

298
00:25:37.125 --> 00:25:39.958
You came to investigate my army.
did you not?

299
00:25:40.917 --> 00:25:42.958
Did you think you would go unnoticed?

300
00:25:47.125 --> 00:25:48.125
Uh...

301
00:25:48.917 --> 00:25:50.309
That's a good point. Yeah.

302
00:25:50.333 --> 00:25:52.184
Juro's been looking for masterless Jedi

303
00:25:52.208 --> 00:25:54.726
and there's a chance
that he could be one of them.

304
00:25:54.750 --> 00:25:56.893
Hey. you. You a spy or something?

305
00:25:56.917 --> 00:25:59.582
You know. I bet he thinks
he's better than us.

306
00:26:07.500 --> 00:26:09.375
Huh. Not half bad.

307
00:26:10.000 --> 00:26:12.583
Agreed. You are quite skilled.

308
00:26:13.167 --> 00:26:15.518
However. with no lightsaber.

309
00:26:15.542 --> 00:26:19.351
I suppose that spear
is a more suitable weapon than a blaster.

310
00:26:19.375 --> 00:26:22.809
I had really hoped
that it would not need to come to this.

311
00:26:22.833 --> 00:26:24.750
However. there's no point anymore.

312
00:26:25.333 --> 00:26:27.542
This is a great opportunity.

313
00:26:28.208 --> 00:26:30.292
Now I can simply fight you.

314
00:26:31.458 --> 00:26:32.893
Tell me your name.

315
00:26:32.917 --> 00:26:35.393
I will not give my name to a tyrant.

316
00:26:35.417 --> 00:26:37.542
How noble of you.

317
00:26:57.542 --> 00:26:58.542
It's blue.

318
00:26:59.375 --> 00:27:01.042
Is Nawaam a Jedi?

319
00:27:02.500 --> 00:27:03.542
How?

319
00:27:04.305 --> 00:28:04.325
